			<div class="row zonetitre__title">
				<div class="col-md-12" role="main">
					<h1 class="mainTitle">Securities Services</h1>
					<p class="intro">Recognised for the quality of its services, the agility of its solutions and the extent of its international network, Societe Generale Securities Services offers a full range of securities services that are adapted to the latest financial markets and regulatory trends.<br>
The SGSS client portal, MySGSS, provides clients with a unique online access to pilot their SGSS services and operations and gives them a global vision of their activity.</p>
				</div>
			</div>


			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-md-12" >
					<div class="headerImage" data-ratio="1.5" data-stellar-background-ratio="0.5">	<img srcset="/typo3temp/assets/_processed_/4/8/csm_header_securities_services_870fc85db2.webp 810w, /typo3temp/assets/_processed_/4/8/csm_header_securities_services_9d43e3cfd1.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" src="/typo3temp/assets/_processed_/4/8/csm_header_securities_services_9d43e3cfd1.webp" width="1920" height="1281" alt="" /></div>
                </div>
            </div>


			
		</div><!-- fin de maincontainer -->
	</div><!-- fint zonetitre-->


	

	<div class="container container_fullwide content">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-md-12 mainCol" role="main">
				<div class="containerContent">
					<div data-anchor="#c77473" class="ttcContent  default" >
<div id="c77473" class="frame frame-default frame-type-container-2cols-75-25 frame-layout-0"><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-9 gridCol thinCol"><div data-anchor="#c72946" class="ttcContent  default" ><div id="c72946" class="frame frame-default frame-type-shortcut frame-layout-0"><div data-anchor="#c46467" class="ttcContent  default" ><div id="c46467" class="frame frame-default frame-type-textpic frame-layout-0"><h3 class="">
				Building tomorrow
			</h3><div class="ce-textpic ce-left ce-intext"><div class="ce-bodytext"><p class="bodytext">Our ambition is to be&nbsp;the reference partner in our main markets, recognised for our service quality and competitiveness, agile solutions and international network coverage.<br><br> We build long-lasting,&nbsp;collaborative relationships&nbsp;with our clients&nbsp;to help them go further in their development. In today’s constantly evolving and complex world, we strive to provide our clients with increasingly&nbsp;efficient and reliable securities services&nbsp;on a daily basis to ensure they get ahead.<br><br> Our clients are&nbsp;<b>institutional investors</b>&nbsp;(insurance companies, pension funds, governmental organisations and international organisations),&nbsp;<b>asset managers, financial intermediaries</b>&nbsp;(brokers, investments banks, private banks, commercial banks)&nbsp;<b>and corporates</b><strong>.</strong><br><br> Established in&nbsp;<b>19 locations in 17 countries</b><strong>,</strong>&nbsp;Societe Generale Securities Services (SGSS) provides a&nbsp;full range of <b>securities services</b>&nbsp;that are&nbsp;adapted to the latest financial markets and regulatory trends: clearing services, custody and trustee services, retail custody services, liquidity management, fund administration and asset servicing, fund distribution and global issuer services.&nbsp;</p><p class="bodytext"><strong>SGSS ranks among the three largest European custodians and the top ten worldwide,</strong> with<strong> EUR 5,901bn* of assets under custody. </strong>SGSS provides<strong> custody &amp; trustee services for 3,663* funds </strong>and the<strong> valuation of 2,477* funds, </strong>representing<strong> assets under administration of EUR 744bn*. </strong>SGSS ranks among the European leaders in stock option management.</p><p class="bodytext">More information on securities services&nbsp;website: <a href="https://www.securities-services.societegenerale.com/en/about/" target="_blank">https://securities-services.societegenerale.com</a>&nbsp;</p><p class="bodytext"><span class="bodytext text--minor"><em>*Figures at end June 2026.</em></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-sm-3 gridCol"><div data-anchor="#c110531" class="ttcContent  default" ><div id="c110531" class="frame frame-default frame-type-textpic frame-layout-0"><h5 class=""><a href="https://www.securities-services.societegenerale.com/en/solution-finder/">Access to Societe Generale Securities Services website</a></h5><div class="ce-textpic ce-center ce-above"></div></div></div></div></div></div>

</div>
				</div>
				


